weakspot.general.combodisplayenabled.tooltip=[Client] Show your hit streak (combo) on screen.\nCounted like the hit sound's scale: it breaks after about 2 seconds without a hit. Shown from 2.
weakspot.general.comboscale.tooltip=[Client] Size multiplier of the combo number.
weakspot.general.comboposition.tooltip=[Client] Where to show the combo.\nBELOW_CROSSHAIR, RIGHT_OF_CROSSHAIR, TOP_CENTER (below boss bars)
weakspot.general.combomilestoneeffects.tooltip=[Client] Accent sound and glow when the combo reaches 10, 25, 50 and 100.
weakspot.general.blockhealthbarenabled.tooltip=[Client] Show the remaining health of the block you are mining as a green bar along the bottom margin of its face.\nOnly for blocks you mine by holding left click that can have a weak spot.
weakspot.general.weakspottrailenabled.tooltip=[Client] Animate weak spots as they move: the marker quickly slides to its new place, leaving a short trail.\nVisual only: hits count at the new place immediately. Off switches in place. Also applies to other players' markers.

key.weakspot.toggle=Toggle Weak Spots
weakspot.toggle.on=Weak Spots: On
weakspot.toggle.off=Weak Spots: Off
weakspot.toggle.offReminder=Weak Spots: Off (press %s to toggle)
weakspot.general.growthbarenabled.tooltip=[Client] Show a yellow growth bar at the foot of a crop while its weak spot is shown.\nOnly while you hold right click with an empty hand on it.
weakspot.general.othermarkershape.tooltip=[Client] Shape of other players' weak spot markers.\nCIRCLE (filled), RING (hollow), DIAMOND, SQUARE. Your own marker stays a filled circle.
weakspot.general.weakspotsenabled.tooltip=[Client] Turn your own weak spots on or off (the Toggle Weak Spots key switches it).\nWhile off, your weak spots do not appear and the game plays as usual. Other players' markers are still shown.

